WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:05.203
Sales Outcomes shows how closed deals went, and the reasons your team recorded.

00:00:05.203 --> 00:00:08.743
Win rate counts won deals out of all closed deals.

00:00:08.743 --> 00:00:10.344
Switch to Close reasons.

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:15.824
Loss reasons lists what your team recorded, and how many deals each covers.

00:00:15.879 --> 00:00:20.160
When a reason grows, one line compares it with the prior period.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.680
Use it to decide where to fix pricing, positioning, or sales material.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.940
Win reasons shows what your wins have in common.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.920
Coach on patterns you can see in your own records.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.400
Become a design partner at revenue.opsgs.com.
